WEBVTT - Powermail (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.759
Long forms put people off, spam fills the inbox, and many captchas make visitors solve puzzles.

2
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:17.846
Powermail lets editors build forms in the backend, and Desiderio styles every field.

3
00:00:19.096 --> 00:00:23.758
Editors manage every form, and see the pages that use it.

4
00:00:24.808 --> 00:00:30.150
Each error shows at its field, and the server checks everything again.

5
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.829
Long forms split into steps, and Friendly Captcha guards the last one.

6
00:00:37.879 --> 00:00:42.959
Every field follows the theme preset, in light and dark mode.

7
00:00:44.259 --> 00:00:47.250
Powermail, styled by Desiderio.
